## 588. 有限矩前缀紧致拼接

```lean
theorem all_finite_Hausdorff_representations_glue
    (a : ℕ → ℝ)
    (mass : ℝ)
    (hFinite :
      ∀ N, ∃ μ : Measure ℝ,
        IsFiniteMeasure μ ∧
        μ (Set.Icc 0 1) = mass ∧
        ∀ n ≤ N,
          ∫ x, x ^ n ∂μ = a n) :
    ∃ μ : Measure ℝ,
      IsFiniteMeasure μ ∧
      MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure
        (mass⁻¹ • μ) ∧
      μ.support ⊆ Set.Icc 0 1 ∧
      ∀ n,
        ∫ x, x ^ n ∂μ = a n
```

